    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>You won't last two hours playing this game!</u></h2><br><i>\u2014What's Carlos Klauss - Episode Zer\u00d8 about? Well, Carlos is quite a hassle to explain.<br>Is it a game? Well, yeah... but no.<br>Is it a Visual Novel, a Graphical Adventure, a point-and-click? Well, a little bit of this, a little bit of that, you know how it rolls.<br>Do I get to make my own choices? Well not really, but you still get to make them.<br>If we were to measure the freedom this game gives you, in a 1 to 10 scale, Carlos would be in lockup.<br>I wouldn't vouch for Carlos to any person disliking games in general. All the fewer recommendations for someone who does, in fact, enjoy them.<br>Because the essence of Carlos isn't a game... Carlos is...<br>\u2014Hey, Chief, I only asked if this is the bus stop for the 87 line.<br>\u2014Oh, sorry about that. No, not here, just around the corner.</i><br><br><strong>Play Carlos Klauss - Episode Zer\u00d8 and unveil the tale of Carlos and his related (and maybe not so related) life occurrences, spinning the threads of this passionate attempt we call a story!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470780/extras/084a1300011e790df9d39b7c67ce2520.avif?t=1749187259\" /></span><br><br><strong>Features? Sure, have at you:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Humble, independent. The world's dimmest budget fund in the last 50 years.<br></li><li>You get to know Carlos the Mannequin in full spirit, have a little chit-chat, he's alright. You also talk to him in first person.<br></li><li>Varied sketches of different styles.<br></li><li>Cool little tunes.<br></li><li>Embedded with an included tutorial.<br></li><li>Straighter-lined than our Obelisk.<br></li><li>Based on real events.</li></ul><br><i>Electronic game displayed via screen. Play with moderation.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470780/extras/6e38a12f054b634a342ee78d15121cff.poster.avif?t=1749187259\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470780/extras/6e38a12f054b634a342ee78d15121cff.webp?t=1749187259\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470780/extras/6e38a12f054b634a342ee78d15121cff.poster.avif?t=1749187259\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470780/extras/6e38a12f054b634a342ee78d15121cff.webp?t=1749187259\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470780/extras/6e38a12f054b634a342ee78d15121cff.poster.avif?t=1749187259\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470780/extras/6e38a12f054b634a342ee78d15121cff.webp?t=1749187259\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470780/extras/6e38a12f054b634a342ee78d15121cff.poster.avif?t=1749187259\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470780/extras/6e38a12f054b634a342ee78d15121cff.webp?t=1749187259\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470780/extras/6e38a12f054b634a342ee78d15121cff.poster.avif?t=1749187259\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470780/extras/6e38a12f054b634a342ee78d15121cff.webp?t=1749187259\" clas